{"RukuNumber":297,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":33,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَقَالَ ٱلۡمَلَأُ مِن قَوۡمِهِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُواْ وَكَذَّبُواْ بِلِقَآءِ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ وَأَتۡرَفۡنَٰهُمۡ فِي ٱلۡحَيَوٰةِ ٱلدُّنۡيَا مَا هَٰذَآ إِلَّا بَشَرٞ مِّثۡلُكُمۡ يَأۡكُلُ مِمَّا تَأۡكُلُونَ مِنۡهُ وَيَشۡرَبُ مِمَّا تَشۡرَبُونَ","TajweedText":"وَقَالَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْمَلَأُ مِ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َوْمِهِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> وَكَذَّبُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> بِلِق<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَخِرَةِ وَأَتْرَفْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ فِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْحَيَ<tajweed class=slnt>و</tajweed><tajweed class=madda_normal>ٲ</tajweed>ةِ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed><tajweed class=laam_shamsiyah>ل</tajweed>دُّنْيَا مَا هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>ذ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> إِلَّا بَشَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رٌ م</tajweed>ِّثْلُكُمْ يَأْكُلُ مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا تَأْكُلُونَ مِنْهُ وَيَشْرَبُ مِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َا تَشْرَب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٣</span>","End":"٣٣","PageNumber":344,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":137,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":34,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَلَئِنۡ أَطَعۡتُم بَشَرٗا مِّثۡلَكُمۡ إِنَّكُمۡ إِذٗا لَّخَٰسِرُونَ","TajweedText":"وَلَئِنْ أَطَعْت<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>َشَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رًا م</tajweed>ِّثْلَكُمْ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َكُمْ إِ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ذًا ل</tajweed>َّخَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>سِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٣٤</span>",