madda_obligatory>َا</tajweed>ٓءَ أُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>ةً ر</tajweed>َّسُولُهَا كَذَّبُوهُ‌ۚ فَأَتْبَعْنَا بَعْضَه<tajweed class=ikhafa_shafawi>ُم ب</tajweed>َعْ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ضًا و</tajweed>َجَعَلْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُمْ أَحَادِيثَ‌ۚ فَبُعْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>دًا ل</tajweed>ِّقَوْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>مٍ ل</tajweed>َّا يُؤْمِن<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٤</span>","End":"٤٤","PageNumber":345,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":45,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"ثُمَّ أَرۡسَلۡنَا مُوسَىٰ وَأَخَاهُ هَٰرُونَ بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا وَسُلۡطَٰنٖ مُّبِينٍ","TajweedText":"ثُ<tajweed class=ghunnah>مّ</tajweed>َ أَرْسَلْنَا مُوسَىٰ وَأَخَاهُ هَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>رُونَ بِـَٔـايَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>تِنَا وَسُلْطَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>نٍ م</tajweed>ُّب<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نٍ <span class=end>٤٥</span>","End":"٤٥","PageNumber":345,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":23,"SurahIndex":"023","VerseNumber":46,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"إِلَىٰ فِرۡعَوۡنَ وَمَلَإِيْهِۦ فَٱسۡتَكۡبَرُواْ وَكَانُواْ قَوۡمًا عَالِينَ","TajweedText":"إِلَىٰ فِرْعَوْنَ وَمَلَإِ<tajweed class=slnt>يْ</tajweed>ه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> فَ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>سْتَكْبَرُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> وَكَانُو<tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> قَوْمًا عَال<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤٦</span>","End":"٤٦","PageNumber":345,"JuzNumber":18,"ManzilNumber":4,"RukuNumber":297,"MaqraNumber":138,"HizbNumber":35,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSa